# ==============================================================================
# To avoid overloading the "subject.en.sale.map" file,
# we add product-specific rules to this file.
#
# If the number of entries becomes really large,
# they will even be put in their own file.
#
# The same products have been offered repeatedly from Germany for many years.
# This spam is eliminated here.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Language: english
# Weight:   12.0
# ==============================================================================

# Drones
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/drone.{1,15}(deal|unbeatable|value)/i

/(compact|foldable|friendly|lightweight|money|perfect|this 4k|ultimate).{1,10}drone/i

/tactic(al)?.{1,15}drone/i
/tactic(al)?.{1,20}camera.{1,10}drone/i

/most (efficient|portable).{1,10}drone/i

